          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>A good laugh comes from the belly, and by laughing every day, yours has grown quite strong. You have a belly melee unarmed Strike, which deals 1d6 bludgeoning damage, is in the brawling group, and has the forceful trait.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> It's never too late to learn to laugh, so you can select this feat at any level and retrain into and out of this feat.</p>"
